CORE
constant-packed-array-oob.sv
--allow-constant-oob-read --bound 1
^file .*constant-packed-array-oob.sv line 4: range-oob: constant packed read \[3:2\] is outside declared range \[2:1\]$
^\[packed_oob\.p_in\].*: PROVED up to bound 1$
^\[packed_oob\.p_unknown\].*: PROVED up to bound 1$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
